OL,3,AHundreds of prisoners being let out
OL,4,Atoday as new early release scheme
OL,5,Astarts
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I am scared that he will come after me
OL,8,F- I don't want to die," one victim
OL,9,Ftells us - while another woman says
OL,10,Fshe's suffering "night terrors and
OL,11,Fpanic"
OL,13,FRestriction zones will control the
OL,14,Fmovements of the most serious
OL,15,Foffenders, while the government
OL,16,Fpromises a record roll-out of ankle
OL,17,Fmonitors
OL,19,FThere are expected to be around 4,500
OL,20,Freleases as part of the phased scheme -
OL,21,Ftoday's is just the first round
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
